#: 229cd4693b9f49b4bc2aea63dab15976 234f2c1189a14cc89de9c13265db2c84
#: c4a9a6b4a04844088c2b399c2f9f9a9e ec19da72b5544f9688d731c35edee7ea
msgid ""
"The PPM pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"PPM 引脚默认映射到定时器输入，可用于除 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 之外的所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议（这两者需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，以这种方式连接时，FPort 只能提供 RC 而没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:70
#: 0720dd9d521943c29a2d52985f310ff6 166b768ca7524928ad6b044a8a652704
#: 1e5614e2a70f4dc9b18c971c855fd829 7c8209c7a114414b93cc9ef8820d5edc
#: b0a10d50b8634f82a2f92c46da75e90c b33f61056ce34fd1ad3326fc5c8e4c9c
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the SBUS pin can also be configured to be used as true UART1 RX "
"pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL1 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"若要启用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，SBUS 引脚也可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 「1」来配置为真正的 UART1 RX 引脚，用于双向系统，从而成为"
" SERIAL1 端口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:72
#: 1915e27f9c854f28b94df75f8c6dab3c 5b43c461e20d4851845f08eba992cd6c
#: 6a45403d73454d0db65c1e27525e061d a63854c0fa1f4427b6bca199b53b8fd9
#: d8b823c2005c420da1e2a21487a78848 ee507217609a4abd8b9c9b43daf4bf89
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 「23」，且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:74
#: 2c00f55b34814157884d76fec44fa96e ac03bd8569974a44ac5f97ecd5c9a1b7
#: ac21d4b2796c47248bce835acfffd4d1 b8270042a2d9490d960cba4893425b58
#: bd2d79198c934f25ad844b805c7200d1 d4820650fda64c2ea97d42581280ed60
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:76
#: 01e6508446c046aa8cfeb0574b8ee511 054694ab9a524dee9f80170a8b418696
#: 41c747b5bfe04c99b78dee9c1d5c2f5e 9f254db4eb1f4a878519b75205b5be9d
#: bd2694910bfa406789b6ce6aba6b8404 f044b490dc7441e897c7255c9d63fd09
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the PPM pin, but SBUS is not supported without an "
"external inverter."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 PPM 引脚，但 SBUS 不支持外部反相器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:78
#: 2f6559a0ee0a4814ba3a109ee3ac2795 6318b40966654fd2a7b06f109b3a59ba
#: 7adfb94383c244bdb48a2af00c67112c bd6217bd12eb4f1886320c6aa5cfcc5d
#: c8423ca64ada4126900e3b8359c0c974 d0a1ad12d9bf4171926e4d333aafaa1d
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T1 and PPM(R1) via a bi-directional inverter. "
"See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向反相器连接到 T1 和 PPM（R1）。参见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:80
#: 1036224d3bc7455c8be379c5c4ecd401 1054cbb7798545aca7ce846d05bceaed
#: 15781b4fc2214fd988e569071d3f04e4 210fc290252f4e5c903ce9a06d8ea471
#: 234af514c5d04943994d6e98c556bd0a d2b79e37c9bd4e5fac234d1030632536
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T1 connection, in addition to PPM (R1), and "
"automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 PPM（R1）外还需要 T1 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:82
#: 3c1fa41fc0cb4ae8a27ac0f399a04059 66f1d17c13bf4a8f9bf9df2e481757dc
#: 7f9ea3c5dd874f75a287b69513ede605 a042090cf1b143a0bf124676de83c788
#: b89d95bae85e4913876d329f4acd44fe edda949afbeb4d3aa4dc8879011955ad
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T1 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接 T1 并自动提供数传数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:84
#: 0da377144f3f4b0a9266c63a472592dd 2a47b9591309487e91e4619778d7f6c8
#: 30a960be88ba47c98d01559e5a2aab0d 518f836d728248b2bca0630b9a7b8f3f
#: a058768c2af54f23a3f4e8fe70d8847e a08a78498c554c34bb9b487620eaf38a
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion)."
" See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任意 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，与除 PPM 外的所有协议兼容（SBUS 需要外部反相）。详情见 "
":ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

