"The Mamba F405 MK2 has an integrated OSD enabled by "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` =` 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
msgstr ""
"Mamba F405 MK2 内置 OSD，通过 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` =` 1（MAX7456 驱动）启用。"

