msgid ""
"The Mamba Basic autopilots do not have a builting compass, but you can "
"attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads or refer to "
":ref:`common-compassless`."
msgstr ""
"Mamba Basic 飞控没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘使用 I2C 连接外部罗盘，或参考 :ref:`common-"
"compassless`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:123
#: 0465a4ec0b72493d92ab47cc921e4e9c 0dbf6deabf684536b7d40e9dd20c7747
